    "text": "THE notice is hereby given under the subsection (01) in the section 07 of the land acquisition Act (Amended) No. 28 of 1964 as the government indents to acquire the below mentioned land/ Servitude for a public purpose. The description of the land to be acquired - Acquiring land to be widening the Road drawn from Keraminiya to Pathiraja Road.",
